/**
 * @file
 * Primary module hooks for Horizontal Event Calendar module.
 *
 * The calendar is delivered via a Block plugin (HorizontalEventCalendarBlock)
 * which can be placed on any page through the standard Drupal block UI.
 * The library is attached by the block itself — not globally — so it only
 * loads on pages where the block is actually placed.
 */
